OL,3,AGoogle Cloud says 'power event' behind
OL,4,Aoutage hitting UK banks and websites
OL,5,
OL,6,FGoogle Cloud has said a "power event"
OL,7,Fis behind an outage affecting a range
OL,8,Fof online services in the UK, including
OL,9,Fbanks and the courts.
OL,11,FThe company, which is one of a handful
OL,12,Fof large cloud computing providers
OL,13,Fwhose infrastructure and services are
OL,14,Fused to power millions of online
OL,15,Fplatforms, reported an "issue with
OL,16,Fmultiple services" at its UK data
OL,17,Fcentre complex "europe-west2".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
