OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F107A1792500860
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AGoogle Cloud says 'power event' behind
OL,4,Aoutage hitting UK banks and websites
OL,5,
OL,6,FBanks Revolut, Lloyds and Halifax are
OL,7,Famong those to report disruption to
OL,8,Ftheir apps, thought the link to the
OL,9,FGoogle Cloud outage has not been
OL,10,Fofficially confirmed.
OL,12,FGoogle Cloud has not given a clear
OL,13,Ftimeline for when the issues will be
OL,14,Fresolved but it has apologised "to all
OL,15,Fwho are affected by the disruption".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
